                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game sat in my library forever. At first it felt fine, but I'd quickly drop it. I randomly decided to give it a dedicated focus. I'm really impressed with it. New mechanics are constantly being introduced and the puzzles are very clever. None feel overly difficult, although challenge is ramped up by optional collectibles - a great way to have a game both be approachable and hard at the same time. I can't play it for too long, but it's great an hour here an hour there.",
